{"id":"e6fd74a4291b286e","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-maltsev-congruence.md","title":"Congruence Extension Instance","display":"Congruence Extension Instance","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-thm-maltsev-congruence","aliases":["93-thm-maltsev-congruence"],"display":"Congruence Extension Instance","depends_on":["[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-subalgebra]]","[[93-df-congruence]]","[[93-df-congruence-extension]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-maltsev-congruence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-maltsev-congruence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Congruence Extension Instance"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" href=\"?note=154cc3ca1a9b40e2\" title=\"93-df-subalgebra\">93-df-subalgebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"30b341bfbd8b5301\" href=\"?note=30b341bfbd8b5301\" title=\"93-df-congruence\">93-df-congruence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"40368e43da5f58fb\" href=\"?note=40368e43da5f58fb\" title=\"93-df-congruence-extension\">93-df-congruence-extension</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-maltsev-congruence-—-Congruence-Extension-Instance\">thm-maltsev-congruence — Congruence Extension Instance</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CEP}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CEP}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathbf B,\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathbf B,\\mathbf A)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf B)\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf B)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}maltsev\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CEP}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathbf B,\\mathbf A)\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf B)\n\\to\\exists\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n\\bigl(\\phi\\cap(|\\mathbf B|\\times|\\mathbf B|)=\\theta\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}maltsev\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CEP}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathbf B,\\mathbf A)\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf B)\n\\to\\exists\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n\\bigl(\\phi\\cap(|\\mathbf B|\\times|\\mathbf B|)=\\theta\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Congruence extension is an additional property of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A\">\\(\\mathbf A\\)</span>; it is false for arbitrary algebras.  The legacy label is retained, but the statement is an instance of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"40368e43da5f58fb\" href=\"?note=40368e43da5f58fb\" title=\"93-df-congruence-extension\">93-df-congruence-extension</a>, not an unconditional Maltsev lemma.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-maltsev-congruence-—-Congruence-Extension-Instance","text":"thm-maltsev-congruence — Congruence Extension Instance","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-subalgebra","status":"resolved","id":"154cc3ca1a9b40e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-subalgebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence","status":"resolved","id":"30b341bfbd8b5301","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-extension","status":"resolved","id":"40368e43da5f58fb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-congruence-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-congruence-extension","status":"resolved","id":"40368e43da5f58fb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Congruence extension is an additional property of $\\mathbf A$; it is false for arbitrary algebras.  The legacy label is retained, but the statement is an instance of [[93-df-congruence-extension]], not an unconditional Maltsev lemma.","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{CEP}_{93}(\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathbf B,\\mathbf A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}maltsev\\text{-}congruence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CEP}_{93}(\\mathbf A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Subalg}_{93}(\\mathbf B,\\mathbf A)\\land\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf B)\n\\to\\exists\\phi\\in\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathbf A)\\;\n\\bigl(\\phi\\cap(|\\mathbf B|\\times|\\mathbf B|)=\\theta\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf A","display":false}],"bytes":1036,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["6730349967b8ffce","154cc3ca1a9b40e2","30b341bfbd8b5301","40368e43da5f58fb"]}